  "content": "<div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4BwOAe.png\"><span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Vs9AVkxjYY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZEORx0F.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></a> </span> <span> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LrVLC2a.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a></span></p>\n<p>此模組提供類似 NEI 的亮度疊加顯示功能。</p>\n<p>本模組需要 Rift、Forge 或 Fabric。（Fabric 需安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config (Fabric)</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a>；Forge 需安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config (Forge)</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a>）</p>\n<p>Light Overlay 是<b>僅限客戶端</b>使用的模組，將其安裝在伺服器上不會有任何作用。</p>\n<p>按下&nbsp;<strong>F7</strong>&nbsp;可切換亮度疊加顯示，並可透過控制設定進行按鍵設定。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:36px\"><strong>黃色</strong></span> 十字表示怪物可在夜間生成，<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:36px\"><strong>紅色</strong></span> 十字表示怪物隨時都能生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:36px\"><strong>藍色</strong></span> 十字表示若有生怪磚時怪物可生成（僅限 1.18 版本）</span></p>\n</div><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>設定：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">Rift 1.13.2：無設定畫面</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">Forge 1.13.x：無設定畫面</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">Forge 1.14+：模組列表 &gt;&nbsp;<strong>設定</strong></li>\n<li>Fabric 1.14+：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> &gt;&nbsp;<strong>設定</strong>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要伺服器與朋友一起遊玩？或不知道如何架設？直接租用已經設定好的伺服器！</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fshedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"333\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（至少 4 GB），使用我的代碼&nbsp;<strong>shedaniel</strong>&nbsp;即可在首月享有&nbsp;<strong>25%</strong>&nbsp;折扣，開始與朋友們盡情遊玩</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/523251999899385875/540546865100488746/unknown.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/523251999899385875/673738838954475521/unknown.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/datg1nL.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>已知問題：</strong></p>\n<p>本模組與 OptiFine 光影效果搭配不佳：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/shedaniel/LightOverlay-Fabric/issues/5\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/shedaniel/LightOverlay-Fabric/issues/5</a>，但您可以使用數字顯示模式，此模式可與光影效果正常運作。</p>\n</div><div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<section>&lt;header class=\"h2  no-sub no-nav\"&gt;&lt;/header&gt;</section>\n</div>",
